# Kinwatch

The remote family member who never sleeps at the door — a Ring + Alexa+ caretaking copilot for people living alone and the adults who worry about them.

No secrets in git. Use env files (gitignored).

This repo is **public** (Amazon Developer Hackathon Official Rules require a public GitHub repo with an OSS license in About).

Oracle/Paperclip is allowed **only** for company **KIN / Kinwatch**.
Do not operate on SYN / Maqom.
Do not operate on CIN / CineTrace AI.
Do not operate on PKN / PocketNode Core.
Do not change `/opt/milepo-oracle` deploy defaults.
Use `.cursor/skills/oracle-connection` and resolve the company by `issuePrefix == "KIN"` (never `companies[0]`).

Do not add `set_lock_state` or any lock actuation. The only partner write is chime playback.
Do not copy `/opt/milepo-oracle/.env` `CURSOR_API_KEY` (SYN host identity). KIN Cursor identity is the Gmail secret copied from CIN/PKN.
Never `gh auth login` on the Oracle host with the KIN PAT; host `gh` stays `insiteu-bot`.
